Z||000000||U Wanna Race||11-17-2001||01:07 AM||||I have an 85 4 cyl.  The throttle cable melted somehow.  When I run my new cable how do I go about doing this?  Does the cable run from the pedal to the engine or is there a cable in the cockpit and another seperate one in the engine bay?  ||||reg||1
