Z||000005||U Wanna Race||11-18-2001||03:53 AM||||I ordered the cable from the fiero store. Should arrive monday, and then let the fun begin.  The reason it melted is because it was touching the AC unit.  And I was on the highway at the time, good times when I had to pull off in the middle of the day when everyone around you is being a jackass and not letting you over.||||reg||1
